African Tokenizer Leaderboard (AfriSpeech)

Based on the Multilingual Tokenizer Leaderboard by Eduardo A. S. Garcia
(https://huggingface.co/spaces/eduagarcia/multilingual-tokenizer-leaderboard),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Modified to evaluate tokenizers on
African languages, using text from the AfriSpeech Africa Corpus.

benchmark/africa_corpus.py is vendored from the Africa Corpus Builder.
